# v2 entrypoint — dramatiq replaces celery.
# concurrency=1 always: Demucs is memory-heavy AND the LLM gateway builds its
# async client per call/loop — multiple threads sharing a process would reuse a
# client across event loops. Pin a single worker (CLAUDE.md worker gotcha).
#
# Queues: `default` carries analyze_audio_job + verdict pipeline actors;
# `coach` (story 1.5) carries coach_reply. Story-1.5 dev/CI runs both queues
# on one process; AR23's W1/W2 split is a production-topology task.
worker: python -m dramatiq app.dramatiq_app --processes 1 --threads 1 --queues default coach
